OL,3,GNEWSACouple killed after portable
OL,4,Aheater exploded and engulfed home in
OL,5,Aflames
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn elderly couple died when a fire
OL,8,Fengulfed their home after an attempt to
OL,9,Frefuel a portable heater resulted in an
OL,10,F"explosion".
OL,12,FMarlene Mumford, 84, and William
OL,13,FMumford, 90, died at their property at
OL,14,FHeol Fawr, Nelson, in Caerphilly
OL,15,Fcounty, last December.
OL,17,FAn inquest in Newport was told that the
OL,18,Fmost likely cause of the fire was a
OL,19,Fmechanical or connection failure with
OL,20,Fthe gas heater.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
