OL,3,GNEWSACouple killed after portable
OL,4,Aheater exploded and engulfed home in
OL,5,Aflames
OL,6,
OL,7,FAssistant coroner Sarah Le Fevre said
OL,8,Fit was believed William Mumford had
OL,9,Fattempted to carry the cylinder out of
OL,10,Fthe home in an effort to remove it, but
OL,11,Fthat this had only caused the flames to
OL,12,Fspread.
